  "description": "For Hoon, moving from Seoul to the middle of nowhere is only bearable because Jae-Hui, the local policeman, is the most beautiful being he's ever seen. Unfortunately, Jae-Hui's dad and Hoon's dad are already dating each other. To make things less weird, Hoon and Jae-Hui must break up their dads by proving their love is more passionate! Too bad Jae-Hui actually hates Hoon… \n\n(Source: Tapas, edited) \n\n *Note: Includes 13 side story chapters.*",
